From 612ae6392f1679e1343fa1b3664bb266b48995fc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "HT9045 Machine (V906)" <Claude_RDBC_02@honprec.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 22:39:47 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] HTDESIGNER-99: the properties list only properties -- a third
 list, </> code (0.99.0)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

EastSun 20260930: "先朝元件屬性和事件的操作先下手 ... 屬性表格和事件可以像 wpf 讓使用者看起來
條理分明". WPF's Properties window shows the properties (or, with the lightning
bolt, the events) and nothing else. Here the properties list went on with the
page's JS listeners, the JS mentioning the component, the commands it sends to
C++, its data field, the data tag it shows and the code using it -- a long tail
under the grid. Now those six sections are a third list, 〔</> 程式碼〕, next to
〔屬性〕 and 〔⚡ 事件〕 (remembered; its own search placeholder); the properties
list keeps the editable grid, the DFM properties and the HTML.

WPF_DIFF_LOG.md: the new priority noted (properties and events first; the
settings items 28-31 wait); 0.98 commit filled in.

Tests (all 4 layers pass: lib 160, smoke 186, panels, real VS Code 159):
panels (the properties list has none of the six; the code list has the
commands, the data field, recipe.doc.put, [Hotplate Form] X Start).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
